"celle d’un éclair."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_1_families.h:3942
msgid ""
"This Pikachu wears its partner's cap, which\\nis proof of the strong bond "
"Pikachu and\\nits partner formed as the two overcame\\nmany hardships "
