"de\\nparanormal, mais ils n’ont guère\\nd’autres points communs."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5890
msgid "SLITHER WING"
msgstr "RAMPE-AILES"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5896
msgid ""
"This mysterious Pokémon has some\\nsimilarities to a creature that an\\nold "
"book introduced as Slither Wing."
msgstr ""
"Ce Pokémon mystérieux ressemble à\\nune créature qu’un vieux "
"livre\\nappelait Rampe-Ailes."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5956
msgid "SANDY SHOCKS"
msgstr "PELAGE-SABLE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:5962
