"The grudge of a person punished\\nfor writing the king's evil deeds "
"upon\\nwooden tablets has clad itself in\\ndead leaves to become a Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"La rancune d’un homme puni pour\\navoir gravé les méfaits du roi sur\\ndes "
