"This seems to be the Iron Serpent\\nmentioned in an Violet Book. The\\nIron "
"Serpent is said to have turned the\\nland to ash with its lightning."
msgstr ""
"Il s’agirait du Serpent de Fer cité\\ndans un Livre Violet. On dit "
"qu’il\\nréduisit la terre en cendres avec\\nses éclairs."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7411
msgid "WALKING WAKE"
msgstr "SERPENTE-EAU"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7417
