"rochers\\navec ses lames étincelantes."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7542
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7610
msgid "POLTCHAGEIST"
msgstr "POLTCHAGEIST"

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7545
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7613
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7681
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7747
msgid "Matcha"
msgstr "Matcha"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7548
msgid ""
"Supposedly, the regrets of a tea\\nceremony master who died "
"before\\nperfecting his craft lingered in some\\nmatcha and became a "
"Pokémon."
msgstr ""
"On raconte que les regrets d’un\\nmaître de thé, mort avant "
"d’avoir\\nperfectionné son art, ont imprégné\\nun matcha devenu Pokémon."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7616
msgid ""
"It has taken up residence in a very\\nexpensive tea caddy. It takes "
"an\\nexpert to distinguish the expensive\\ntea caddies from the cheap ones."
msgstr ""
"Il a élu domicile dans une boîte\\nà thé hors de prix. Seul un expert\\nsait"
" distinguer les boîtes de valeur\\ndes simples imitations."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7678
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7744
msgid "SINISTCHA"
msgstr "THEFFROYABLE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7684
msgid ""
"It pretends to be tea, trying to fool\\npeople into drinking it so it "
"can\\ndrain their life-force. Its ruse is\\ngenerally unsuccessful."
msgstr ""
"Il se fait passer pour du thé afin\\nqu’on le boive, pour "
"absorber\\nl’énergie vitale des imprudents.\\nSa ruse échoue presque "
"toujours."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7750
msgid ""
"The more stirring it does with the\\ntea whisk on its head, the "
"more\\nenergy it builds up. It does this to\\nprepare for battle."
msgstr ""
"Plus il remue le fouet à thé sur sa\\ntête, plus il accumule "
"d’énergie.\\nC’est ainsi qu’il se prépare\\nau combat."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7812
msgid "OKIDOGI"
msgstr "FELICANIS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7815
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7882
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7949
msgid "Retainer"
msgstr "Serviteur"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7818
msgid ""
"After all its muscles were stimulated\\nby the toxic chain around its "
"neck,\\nOkidogi transformed and gained\\na powerful physique."
msgstr ""
"La chaîne toxique autour de son cou\\na stimulé tous ses muscles. "
"Félicanis\\ns’est alors transformé et a acquis\\nun physique puissant."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7879
msgid "MUNKIDORI"
msgstr "FORTUSIMIA"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7885
msgid ""
"The chain is made from toxins that\\nenhance capabilities. It "
"stimulated\\nMunkidori's brain and caused the\\nPokémon's psychic powers to "
"bloom."
msgstr ""
"Cette chaîne, faite de toxines qui\\ndécuplent les capacités, a stimulé\\nle"
" cerveau de Fortusimia et éveillé\\nses pouvoirs psychiques."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7946
msgid "FEZANDIPITI"
msgstr "FAVIANOS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:7952
msgid ""
"Fezandipiti owes its beautiful looks and\\nlovely voice to the toxic "
"stimulants\\nemanating from the chain wrapped around\\nits body."
msgstr ""
"Favianos doit sa beauté et sa voix\\nenchanteresse aux stimulants\\ntoxiques"
" que diffuse la chaîne\\nenroulée autour de son corps."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8014
msgid "OGERPON"
msgstr "OGERPON"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8017
msgid "Mask"
msgstr "Masque"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8095
msgid "GOUGING FIRE"
msgstr "FEU-PERCANT"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8101
msgid ""
"There are scant few reports of\\nthis creature being sighted.\\nOne short "
"video shows it rampaging,\\nand spouting pillars of flame."
msgstr ""
"On n’a que de rares témoignages\\nsur cette créature. Une courte\\nvidéo la "
"montre en plein saccage,\\ncrachant des colonnes de flammes."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8162
msgid "RAGING BOLT"
msgstr "IRE-FOUDRE"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8168
msgid ""
"It bears resemblance to a Pokémon\\nthat became a hot topic for a "
"short\\nwhile after a paranomal magazine\\ntouted it as Raikou's ancestor."
msgstr ""
"Il ressemble à un Pokémon qui fit\\nsensation après qu’un magazine "
"du\\nparanormal l’eut présenté comme\\nl’ancêtre de Raikou."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8229
msgid "IRON BOULDER"
msgstr "ROC-DE-FER"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8235
msgid ""
"It was named after a mysterious\\nobject recorded in an old book.\\nIts body"
" seems to be metallic."
msgstr ""
"Il tient son nom d’un objet\\nmystérieux décrit dans un vieux livre.\\nSon "
"corps semble métallique."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8295
msgid "IRON CROWN"
msgstr "CHEF-DE-FER"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8301
msgid ""
"It resembles a mysterious object\\nintroduced in a paranormal magazine\\nas "
"a cutting-edge weapon\\nshaped like Cobalion."
msgstr ""
"Il ressemble à un objet mystérieux\\nprésenté par un magazine "
"du\\nparanormal comme une arme futuriste\\nen forme de Cobaltium."

#. source : traduction manuelle (style SoulSilver)
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8362
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8432
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8503
msgid "TERAPAGOS"
msgstr "TERAPAGOS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8365
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8435
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8506
msgid "Tera"
msgstr "Téracristal"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8368
msgid ""
"Terapagos protects itself using its\\npower to transform energy into "
"hard\\ncrystals. This Pokémon is the source\\nof the Terastal phenomenon."
msgstr ""
"Terapagos se protège en changeant\\nl’énergie en cristaux durs. Ce\\nPokémon"
" est à l’origine du\\nphénomène Téracristal."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8438
msgid ""
"The shell is made of crystallized\\nTerastal energy. When struck by a "
"move,\\nthis shell absorbs the move's energy\\nand transfers it to "
"Terapagos."
msgstr ""
"Sa carapace est faite d’énergie\\nTéracristal. Elle absorbe l’énergie\\ndes "
"capacités qui la frappent et\\nla transmet à Terapagos."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8509
msgid ""
"An old expedition journal describes the\\nsight of this Pokémon buried in "
"the,\\ndepths of the earth as resembling a\\nplanet floating in space."
msgstr ""
"Un vieux journal d’expédition\\ncompare ce Pokémon enfoui dans "
"les\\nprofondeurs de la terre à une\\nplanète flottant dans l’espace."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8566
msgid "PECHARUNT"
msgstr "PECHAMINUS"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8569
msgid "Subjugation"
msgstr "Emprise"

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_9_families.h:8572
msgid ""
"It feeds others toxic mochi that\\ndraw out desires and "
"capabilities.\\nThose who eat the mochi fall under\\nPecharunt's control, "
"chained to its will."
msgstr ""
"Il offre des mochis toxiques qui\\néveillent désirs et capacités. Qui\\nen "
"mange tombe sous le contrôle\\nde Pêchaminus, enchaîné à sa volonté."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:9
msgid ""
"It forms a group of Rattata, which it \\nassumes command of. Each "
"group\\nhas its own territory, and disputes\\nover food happen often."
msgstr ""
"Les crocs robustes de Rattatac\\npoussent constamment. Il se fait donc\\nles"
" dents sur des cailloux, des troncs\\nd’arbre, voire des murs de maison."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:15
msgid ""
"It is still inept at retaining electricity.\\nWhen it is startled, it "
"discharges power\\naccidentally. It gets better at holding\\npower as it "
"grows older."
msgstr ""
"Il est incapable de retenir l’électricité en\\nlui et en relâche "
"accidentellement quand\\nil s’agite. Il progresse dans ce domaine "
"en\\ngrandissant."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:21
msgid ""
"It stores electricity in the electric sacs\\non its cheeks. When it releases"
" pent-up\\nenergy in a burst, the electric power is\\nequal to a lightning "
"bolt."
msgstr ""
"Il stocke de l’électricité dans les poches\\nde ses joues. Quand il relâche "
"d’un coup\\ntoute l’énergie accumulée, la puissance\\nélectrique équivaut à "
"celle d’un éclair."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:27
msgid ""
"The cursed flames that light up the bone\\ncarried by this Pokémon are "
"said\\nto cause both mental and physical\\npain that will never fade."
msgstr ""
"Il est la forme évoluée d’Osselait. Il a\\nsurmonté le chagrin causé par la "
"perte de\\nsa maman et s’est endurci. Son tempérament\\nle rend très "
"difficile à amadouer."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:33
msgid ""
"An Eevee has an unstable genetic makeup\\nthat suddenly mutates due to "
"its\\nenvironment. Radiation from various\\nStones causes this Pokémon to "
"evolve."
msgstr ""
"Évoli a une structure génétique instable\\nqui se transforme en fonction de "
"son\\nenvironnement. Il évolue grâce aux\\nradiations de diverses Pierres."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:40
msgid ""
"This Pokémon is shaped like ancient text\\ncharacters. Although research is "
"ongoing,\\nit is a mystery as to which came first,\\nthe ancient writings or"
" the various Unown."
msgstr ""
"Il a la forme d’un caractère d’écriture\\nantique. On ne sait pas si ces "
"écritures\\nantiques sont apparues avant les Zarbi ou\\nle contraire. Des "
"études sont en cours."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:47
msgid ""
"It does not keep a nest. While it\\nloves floral honey, it won't "
"gather\\nany itself. Instead, it plots to steal\\nhoney collected by Combee."
msgstr ""
"Il ne fait pas de nid. Il adore le nectar,\\nmais n’en récolte jamais. Il "
"préfère voler le\\nmiel amassé par les Apitrini."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:53
msgid ""
"It is told in mythology that this Pokémon\\nemerged from an egg and shaped "
"all there\\nis in this world, before the universe\\neven existed."
msgstr ""
"Selon la mythologie, ce Pokémon serait né\\nd’un œuf et aurait façonné le "
"monde entier\\navant même la naissance de l’univers."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:60
msgid ""
"Over 300 million years ago, it was\\nfeared as the strongest of "
"hunters.\\nTeam Plasma altered it and attached\\na cannon to its back."
msgstr ""
"Il y a 300 millions d’années, c’était le plus\\nredouté des chasseurs. La "
"Team Plasma l’a\\nmodifié et lui a greffé un canon sur le dos."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:67
msgid ""
"It appears and vanishes with a ninja's\\ngrace. It toys with its enemies "
"using\\nswift movements, while slicing them with\\nthrowing stars made of "
"compressed water."
msgstr ""
"Il apparaît et disparaît avec l’agilité d’un\\nninja. Il se joue de ses "
"ennemis et les\\ntranche avec des shuriken d’eau\\ncompressée."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:73
msgid ""
"When under attack from bird Pokémon,\\nit spews a poisonous black powder "
"that\\ncauses paralysis on contact. Scatterbug\\ncan live in any region or "
"climate."
msgstr ""
"Attaqué par des Pokémon oiseaux, il crache\\nune poudre noire paralysante. "
"Lépidonille\\npeut vivre sous tous les climats."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:79
msgid ""
"It lives hidden within thicket shadows.\\nWhen predators attack, it quickly "
"bristles\\nthe fur covering its body in an effort to\\nthreaten them."
msgstr ""
"Vit caché sous le couvert des buissons.\\nPoursuivi par un ennemi, il tente "
"de\\nl’intimider en hérissant les poils de son\\ncorps."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:85
msgid ""
"Trimming its fluffy fur not only makes\\nit more elegant but also increases "
"the\\nswiftness of its movements. These\\nPokémon were the guardians of "
"kings."
msgstr ""
"Une coupe de son épais pelage le rend plus\\nélégant mais aussi plus rapide."
" Autrefois,\\nces Pokémon gardaient les rois."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:91
msgid ""
"Legends say that when the horns on\\nits head shine in seven colors, it "
"is\\nsharing everlasting life. It slept for a\\nthousand years in the form "
"of a tree"
msgstr ""
"Selon la légende, il offre la vie éternelle\\nquand ses cornes brillent de "
"sept couleurs.\\nIl a dormi mille ans sous forme d’arbre."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:97
msgid ""
"It's said to be monitoring the ecosystem\\nfrom deep in the caves where it "
"lives.\\nThere are rumors that even greater power\\nlies hidden within its "
"cells."
msgstr ""
"On dit qu’il surveille l’écosystème du fond\\ndes grottes où il vit. Une "
"puissance encore\\nplus grande dormirait dans ses cellules."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:103
msgid ""
"This is Zygarde when about 10% of\\nits pieces have been assembled. "
"It\\nleaps at its opponent's chest and\\nsinks its sharp fangs into them."
msgstr ""
"Voici Zygarde quand environ 10% de\\nses cellules sont réunies. Il "
"bondit\\nsur le torse de l’ennemi et y plante\\nses crocs acérés."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:110
msgid ""
"When it finds a trace of its prey, it\\npatiently stakes out the "
"location...\\nbut as it's diurnal, it's always snoozing\\nby nightfall."
msgstr ""
"Quand il trouve la trace d’une proie, il\\nmonte patiemment la garde… mais "
"comme il\\nvit le jour, il pique un somme dès la nuit\\ntombée."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:116
msgid ""
"It concentrates electrical energy within\\nits large jaws and uses it to zap"
" its foes.\\nIt overwhelms bird Pokémon with shocking\\nbeams of electrical "
"energy."
msgstr ""
"Il concentre l’énergie électrique dans ses\\ngrandes mâchoires pour "
"électrocuter ses\\nennemis. Ses rayons foudroyants\\nterrassent les Pokémon "
"oiseaux."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:122
msgid ""
"Ribombee rolls up pollen into puffs.\\nIt makes many different varieties, "
"some\\nused as food and others used in battle.\\nThey are sometimes sold as "
"supplements."
msgstr ""
"Rubombelle roule le pollen en boulettes de\\ntoutes sortes, pour se nourrir "
"ou pour\\ncombattre. On les vend parfois comme\\ncompléments."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:128
msgid ""
"This Pokémon has lived with people since\\ntimes long ago. It can sense when"
" its\\nTrainer is in the dumps and will stick\\nclose by its Trainer's side."
msgstr ""
"Ce Pokémon vit depuis toujours avec les\\nhumains. Lorsque son Dresseur est "
"triste,\\nil reste à ses côtés pour le soutenir\\nmoralement."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:134
msgid ""
"Despite what its appearance suggests,\\nit cares for others. If it finds "
"vulnerable,\\nweak Pokémon, it protectively brings\\nthem into its water "
"bubble."
msgstr ""
"Bien plus attentionné qu’il n’y paraît, il\\nn’hésite pas à recueillir dans "
"sa bulle ses\\ncamarades plus petits et fragiles."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:140
msgid ""
"It requires a lot of effort to maintain\\nLurantis's vivid coloring, but "
"some\\ncollectors enjoy this work and treat it\\nas their hobby."
msgstr ""
"Préserver ses couleurs éclatantes\\nrequiert un travail titanesque. On "
"trouve\\ntout de même des gens assez fous pour s’y\\natteler."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:146
msgid ""
"For some reason, only females have\\nbeen found. It creates a reverse harem "
"of\\nmale Salandit to live with. Its poisonous\\ngas is filled with "
"pheromones."
msgstr ""
"Pour une raison inconnue, on n’a trouvé que\\ndes femelles. Elle vit "
"entourée d’un harem\\nde Tritox mâles. Son gaz toxique est chargé\\nde "
"phéromones."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:152
msgid ""
"Its trust in its partner awakens it.\\nThis Pokémon is capable of changing "
"its\\ntype by equipping special memories, a\\ntrait that is well displayed "
"in battle."
msgstr ""
"Sa confiance en son partenaire l’a éveillé.\\nIl change de type en "
"s’équipant de ROM\\nspéciales, un talent qui brille au combat."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:158
msgid ""
"Upon awakening, its RKS System is\\nactivated. By employing "
"specific\\nmemories, this Pokémon can adapt its\\ntype to confound its "
"enemies."
msgstr ""
"À son réveil, son Système Alpha\\ns’active. Grâce à des ROM précises,\\nil "
"adapte son type pour dérouter\\nses ennemis."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:164
msgid ""
"Originally making its home in the ozone\\nlayer, it hurtles to the ground "
"when the\\nshell encasing its body grows too heavy.\\nIt was born from "
"mutated nanoparticles."
msgstr ""
"Il vit dans la couche d’ozone et tombe au\\nsol quand sa coque devient trop "
"lourde. Il\\nserait né de nanoparticules mutantes."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:170
msgid ""
"If its core stays exposed, it will\\nsoon die off. It's possible that "
"it\\nmay survive if it's put into a Poké Ball\\nquickly enough."
msgstr ""
"Si son noyau reste exposé, il\\nmourra vite. On peut le sauver en\\nle "
"plaçant assez tôt dans une\\nPoké Ball."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:176
msgid ""
"The spiny fur on its back is normally\\nat rest. When this Pokémon "
"becomes\\nagitated, its fur stands on end and stabs\\ninto its attackers."
msgstr ""
"Les épines de ce Pokémon sont normalement\\nbaissées, mais quand il "
"s’énerve, elles se\\ndressent afin de pourfendre ses\\nagresseurs."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:182
msgid ""
"A lonely Pokémon, it hides its terrifying\\nappearance beneath an old rag so"
" it can\\nget closer to people and other Pokémon.\\nIts actual appearance is"
" unknown."
msgstr ""
"Ce Pokémon solitaire cache son apparence\\nterrifiante sous un vieux chiffon"
" pour se\\nrapprocher des gens. Nul ne connaît son\\nvrai visage."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:188
msgid ""
"After going to all the effort of\\ndisguising itself, its neck was\\nbroken."
" Whatever is inside is probably\\nunharmed, but it's still feeling sad."
msgstr ""
"Après tant d’efforts pour se\\ndéguiser, il s’est brisé le cou. Ce\\nqui est"
" dedans va sans doute bien,\\nmais il reste tout triste."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:194
msgid ""
"Its rigid scales function as offense and\\ndefense. In the past, its scales "
"were\\nprocessed and used to make weapons\\nand other valuable commodities."
msgstr ""
"Ses écailles rigides servent à l’attaque\\ncomme à la défense. Jadis, on "
"les\\ntransformait en armes et autres objets de\\nvaleur."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:201
msgid ""
"If Alcremie is content, the secreted cream\\nfrom its hands becomes sweeter "
"and richer.\\nWhen it trusts a Trainer, it will treat\\nthem to berries it's"
" decorated with cream."
msgstr ""
"Content, Charmilly sécrète une crème plus\\ndouce et onctueuse. S’il a "
"confiance en son\\nDresseur, il lui offre des Baies nappées de\\ncrème."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:207
msgid ""
"The moment it evolved, it took on a\\nsweet and tart flavor. This "
"is\\nbecause of the way its cells\\nspontaneously shifted during evolution."
msgstr ""
"Au moment d’évoluer, il a pris un\\ngoût sucré et acidulé, car "
"ses\\ncellules se sont modifiées\\nspontanément durant l’évolution."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:213
msgid ""
"The moment it evolved, it took on\\nan aromatic flavor. This is because\\nof"
" the way its cells spontaneously\\nshifted during evolution."
msgstr ""
"Au moment d’évoluer, il a pris un\\ngoût aromatique, car ses cellules\\nse "
"sont modifiées spontanément\\ndurant l’évolution."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:219
msgid ""
"The moment it evolved, it took on a\\nrefreshing flavor. This is "
"because\\nof the way its cells spontaneously\\nshifted during evolution."
msgstr ""
"Au moment d’évoluer, il a pris un\\ngoût rafraîchissant, car ses\\ncellules "
"se sont modifiées\\nspontanément durant l’évolution."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:225
msgid ""
"The moment it evolved, it took on a\\nsour flavor. This is because of "
"the\\nway its cells spontaneously shifted\\nduring evolution."
msgstr ""
"Au moment d’évoluer, il a pris un\\ngoût acide, car ses cellules se\\nsont "
"modifiées spontanément durant\\nl’évolution."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:231
msgid ""
"The moment it evolved, it took on a\\nsalty flavor. This is because of "
"the\\nway its cells spontaneously shifted\\nduring evolution."
msgstr ""
"Au moment d’évoluer, il a pris un\\ngoût salé, car ses cellules se\\nsont "
"modifiées spontanément durant\\nl’évolution."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:237
msgid ""
"The moment it evolved, it took on a\\nmixed flavor. This is because of "
"the\\nway its cells spontaneously shifted\\nduring evolution."
msgstr ""
"Au moment d’évoluer, il a pris un\\ngoût mélangé, car ses cellules se\\nsont"
" modifiées spontanément durant\\nl’évolution."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:243
msgid ""
"The moment it evolved, it took on a\\nbitter flavor. This is because "
"of\\nthe way its cells spontaneously\\nshifted during evolution."
msgstr ""
"Au moment d’évoluer, il a pris un\\ngoût amer, car ses cellules se\\nsont "
"modifiées spontanément durant\\nl’évolution."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:249
msgid ""
"The moment it evolved, it took on a\\ncomplex flavor. This is because "
"of\\nthe way its cells spontaneously\\nshifted during evolution."
msgstr ""
"Au moment d’évoluer, il a pris un\\ngoût complexe, car ses cellules "
"se\\nsont modifiées spontanément durant\\nl’évolution."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:255
msgid ""
"Out of control after its own\\npoison penetrated its brain, it "
"tears\\nacross the land in a rampage,\\ncontaminating the earth with toxic "
"sweat."
msgstr ""
"Son propre poison lui est monté\\nau cerveau. Hors de contrôle, il\\nravage "
"tout et contamine la terre\\nde sa sueur toxique."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:262
msgid ""
"This Pokémon's type changes based on\\nwhich mask it's wearing. It "
"confounds\\nits enemies with nimble movements\\nand kicks."
msgstr ""
"Son type change selon le masque\\nqu’il porte. Il déroute ses ennemis\\npar "
"ses mouvements agiles et\\nses coups de pied."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:268
msgid ""
"This form excels in both attack\\nand defense. It ceaselessly "
"unleashes\\nmoves like a spring gushes water."
msgstr ""
"Cette forme excelle en attaque\\ncomme en défense. Ses "
"capacités\\njaillissent telle l’eau d’une source."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:273
msgid ""
"This form is the most aggressive,\\nbombarding enemies with the "
"intensity\\nof flames blazing within a hearth."
msgstr ""
"C’est sa forme la plus agressive.\\nIl pilonne ses ennemis avec "
"l’ardeur\\ndes flammes d’un foyer."

#. source : patch FR actuel
#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/shared_dex_text.h:278
msgid ""
"In this form, it draws on the power\\nof stone. Its body is rock-"
"solid,\\nprotecting it from all manner of\\nattacks."
msgstr ""
"Sous cette forme, il puise dans la\\nforce de la pierre. Son corps "
"dur\\ncomme le roc le protège de toutes\\nsortes d’attaques."

